// Transistor Ladder by Teemu Voipio
// mods by Pete for evieve
// Pete: this is tuned to be quite 'hot' and aggressive compared to "evi_ladder_moog.gendsp".
// @see: evi_ladder_moog.gendsp & evi_ladder_poles.gendsp for alternative ladder emulations
// and @see: evi_ladder_diode.gendsp for a diode ladder emulation

// @see: https://www.kvraudio.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=349859
// (^^ that is the legendary kvr thread where there is lots of useful stuff,
